# Research artifact policy: track selected code, configs, analyses and evidence.
# Keep datasets, model weights, generated images, caches and secrets outside Git.
# See docs/PROVENANCE.md and provenance/excluded_files.csv for export decisions.
# Model/data/environment artifacts; numeric summaries remain versioned.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv*/
.bob_env/
.render_deps/
.cache/
node_modules/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.npz
*.npy
*.pkl
*.zip
*.pid
*.lock
*.tmp
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
generated/
real_images/
external-data/
local-artifacts/
new_runs/

